<div class="bibitem" id="bibitem-1">1. “Use of mSRA ‘Scranton Boxes’ to Provide Mission Critical Document Security”; L. Piedmont et. al.; <em>Foundation</em>; Vol 106.8; pp 10-14; 1988</div>
<div class="bibitem" id="bibitem-2">2. “Relativistic Motion in Superfluids for use in Tachyon Emission and Storage”; T. Xyank, A. Anastasakos; <em>Foundation</em>; Vol 10.4; pp 141-143; 1892</div>
<div class="bibitem" id="bibitem-3">3. “Transit Portal Dynamics: Stretching the Brane”; T. Bailey et al. <em>Foundation</em>; Vol 115.2; pp 23-37; 1997</div>
</div>
